post.description:
Reaches a recipient on a given channel. You target a channel connection (channel_connection_id) — which determines the channel (voice, SMS, WhatsApp…), the agent and the sending line — and choose an action:
- Talk: outbound voice call handled by the AI agent (same options as /leads/v3/phone-call, via `config`);
- Send: send a message (text, media or template), via `message`;
- Chat: outbound conversation handled by the AI agent, via `message`.
The recipient is always provided in `contact`.
